sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web / Gateway
  participant M as MealPlanning
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant R as Recommendation
  participant D as DietKnowledge
  participant G as Gemini
  U->>W: Request meal ideas (tags, days 1-14)
  W->>M: POST /api/meal-recommendations
  M->>M: Save request + OutboxMessage (1 transaction)
  M-->>U: Pending (answered at once)
  M-)Q: Outbox dispatcher publishes recommendation.requests
  Q-)R: Consume
  R->>D: GET approved knowledge / semantic search
  R->>G: generateContent (or safe local fallback)
  R-)Q: Publish recommendation.results
  Q-)M: Consume, status = Completed
  U->>M: Accept (edit) recommendation
  M->>M: Create MealPlan + items, status = Accepted
